-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Material from the Idle Obelisk Miner Wiki
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This app uses content from the Idle Obelisk Miner Wiki
(https://shminer.miraheze.org), written by its editors and licensed under
CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. The authors of each page are listed in that page's history
on the wiki.

Changes made: the wiki's data and formulas were reorganised to run the
calculations, and the guide texts were adapted, shortened and translated
(Italian and English). The adapted material is released under the same
license, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.

